Date: Sun, 11 Jan 2026 23:32:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] zad4

---
 Makefile  |  2 ++
 defs.h    |  5 +++++
 sem.c     | 55 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 syscall.c |  6 ++++++
 syscall.h |  3 +++
 sysproc.c | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 testsem.c | 46 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 user.h    |  3 +++
 usys.S    |  3 +++
 9 files changed, 151 insertions(+)
